  "The package is not the one its manifest names (its SHA-256 differs): it was not installed.": "ແພັກເກັດບໍ່ແມ່ນອັນທີ່ manifest ລະບຸ (SHA-256 ຕ່າງກັນ): ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ.",
